is\n• Piso Porcelanato\n• Piso Vinílico\n• Playground\n• Portão Eletrônico\n• Portaria 24h\n• Quadra Esportiva\n• Quiosque Externo\n• Sacada / Varanda\n• Sala de Estar\n• Sala de Jantar\n• Sala de Jogos\n• Salão de Festas\n• Suíte Master\n• Suíte Standard\n• Terraço\n• Vista Panorâmica","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0001-17145103764979.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0002-17145103764981.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0004-17145103764982.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0005-17145103764983.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0006-17145103764983.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0007-17145103764983.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0008-17145103764983.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0009-17145103764984.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0010-17145103764984.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0051-17145103764995.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0012-17145103764986.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0013-17145103764986.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0014-17145103764987.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-homes-images-watermark/img_0015-17145103764987.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/LEB010/pilar-